From ea59bf16a93c62a37851ad94e63deb1669909fda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:14:08 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Fixa OpenCV 4.x e inclui o classificador Haar em assets/

O opencv-python 5.x nao traz mais haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml,
entao com "opencv-python>=4.5" uma instalacao nova perdia o filtro de
rosto. Limita o OpenCV a <5 e versiona o XML (Intel License Agreement,
aviso mantido no arquivo) para o projeto nao depender do pacote.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F5K64WedrbLuQkZX9P9isz
---
 assets/haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml | 33314 +++++++++++++++++++
 requirements.txt                           |     2 +-
 2 files changed, 33315 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 assets/haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml

diff --git a/assets/haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml b/assets/haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml
new file mode 100644
